  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>geometry-measures-features · 4×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 1024 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-neighbor-search-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"61\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"3\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-neighbor-search-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const ringOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; ringOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const featureOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; featureOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const polygonOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read&gt; polygonOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const featureStatsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; featureStats: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const ROW_COUNT: u32 = 10580u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const RING_COUNT: u32 = 791u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">const IS_POLYGON: bool = true;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">const IS_POINT: bool = false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">const FIRST_RING_EXTERIOR: bool = true;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">const POLYGON_COUNT: u32 = 791u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">fn isShellRing(ring: u32, isFirstRing: bool) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  if (ring &lt; polygonOffsets[polygonOffsetsOffset] || ring &gt;= polygonOffsets[polygonOffsetsOffset + POLYGON_COUNT]) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">    return isFirstRing;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  var low = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  var high = POLYGON_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  while (low &lt; high) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">    let middle = (low + high) / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">    if (polygonOffsets[polygonOffsetsOffset + middle] &lt; ring) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">      low = middle + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">      high = middle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  return polygonOffsets[polygonOffsetsOffset + low] == ring;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">const IS_GEOGRAPHIC: bool = true;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">const STATS_STRIDE: u32 = 16u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">fn geodesicAtan2(y: f32, x: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  return select(atan2(y, x), sign(y) * 1.5707963267948966, x == 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">const GEODESIC_PI: f32 = 3.14159265358979;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">// Component reconstruction avoids polar and long-path cancellation; these boundaries\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">// retain the established short-path arithmetic and are covered by the PROJ regressions.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">const GEODESIC_DIRECT_COMPONENT_ANGLE: f32 = 0.25 * GEODESIC_PI;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">const GEODESIC_DIRECT_POLAR_LATITUDE: f32 = 80.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">const GEODESIC_DIRECT_POLAR_SINE: f32 = 0.984807753012208; // sin(80 degrees)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">const GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS: f32 = 0.0174532925199433;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">const GEODESIC_RADIANS_TO_DEGREES: f32 = 57.2957795130823;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">// Haversine terms remain well conditioned below a 90-degree separation. Compare local snap\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">// candidates in that common representation, before asin/atan2 rounding can reverse a near tie.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">const GEODESIC_LOCAL_COMPARISON_MAXIMUM_TERM: f32 = 0.5;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">fn geodesicWrapLongitudeDelta(delta: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">  return delta - 360.0 * round(delta / 360.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">// Exact turn reduction of finite f32 endpoints. Floating division/subtraction can erase the\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">// remainder of 2^62 degrees. Decode the significand instead; integer remainders cannot be\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">// reassociated by Metal. 104 is the largest shift (exponent 127 minus 23 significand bits).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">fn geodesicReduceLongitude(longitude: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  if (abs(longitude) &lt;= 180.0) { return longitude; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  let bits = bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(longitude);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">  let exponentBits = (bits &gt;&gt; 23u) &amp; 255u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  if (exponentBits == 255u) { return bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(0x7fc00000u | (bits &amp; 0u)); }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  let exponent = i32(exponentBits) - 127;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  let significand = (bits &amp; 0x7fffffu) | 0x800000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  var remainder = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  if (exponent &lt; 23) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">    let denominator = 1u &lt;&lt; u32(23 - exponent);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">    remainder = f32(significand % (720u * denominator)) / f32(denominator);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">    var integerRemainder = significand % 720u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">    for (var shift = 0u; shift &lt; 104u; shift++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">      if (shift &gt;= u32(exponent - 23)) { break; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">      integerRemainder = (integerRemainder * 2u) % 720u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">    remainder = f32(integerRemainder);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">  // Retain modulo-720 turn parity for round-to-even half-turn ties, like the core CPU helper.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">  return select(remainder, -remainder, (bits &gt;&gt; 31u) != 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">// Canonicalize a modulo-720 endpoint with integer units. Floating reduced - 360*turns\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">// could be reassociated into the caller&#39;s subtraction, losing a tiny trip from 360 degrees again.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">fn geodesicCanonicalLongitude(reduced: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">  if (abs(reduced) &lt;= 180.0) { return reduced; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">  let bits = bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(reduced);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">  let exponentBits = (bits &gt;&gt; 23u) &amp; 255u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">  if (exponentBits == 255u) { return bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(0x7fc00000u | (bits &amp; 0u)); }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">  let denominator = 1u &lt;&lt; (150u - exponentBits);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">  let significand = (bits &amp; 0x7fffffu) | 0x800000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">  let turnUnits = 360u * denominator;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">  let halfTurnUnits = 180u * denominator;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">  var turns = significand / turnUnits;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">  let remainder = significand % turnUnits;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">  if (remainder &gt; halfTurnUnits || (remainder == halfTurnUnits &amp;&amp; (turns % 2u) != 0u)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">    turns += 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">  let canonical = f32(i32(significand) - i32(turns * turnUnits)) / f32(denominator);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">  return select(canonical, -canonical, (bits &gt;&gt; 31u) != 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">// Subtract near the shared antimeridian before forming the small angular separation.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">// Wrapping (destination - source) afterward cannot recover bits lost by that large subtraction:\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">// 179.341 -&gt; -179.877 loses about 1.6 meters on the OpenFlights sphere fixture.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">fn geodesicLongitudeDelta(source: f32, destination: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">  let reducedSource = geodesicReduceLongitude(source);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">  let reducedDestination = geodesicReduceLongitude(destination);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">  let canonicalSource = geodesicCanonicalLongitude(reducedSource);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">  let canonicalDestination = geodesicCanonicalLongitude(reducedDestination);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">  // These differences are exact whole turns; avoid backend-dependent round(+-0.5) ties.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">  let sourceTurns = i32((reducedSource - canonicalSource) / 360.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">  let destinationTurns = i32((reducedDestination - canonicalDestination) / 360.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">  // WGSL permits floating-point reassociation: the two seam-relative subtractions below\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">  // can become (destination - source) - 2 * halfTurn, restoring the cancellation.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">  // For opposite seam quadrants, every f32 endpoint is exactly a multiple of 2^-17\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">  // degrees (the smallest ulp on [90, 180]). Scale by that power of two and wrap in\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">  // i32: magnitudes stay below 2^26, with no quantization or integer overflow. Only\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">  // the final, small difference is converted back to f32, so reassociation cannot\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">  // reintroduce a large floating-point subtraction.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">  if (abs(canonicalSource) &gt; 90.0 &amp;&amp; abs(canonicalSource) &lt;= 180.0 &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">      abs(canonicalDestination) &gt; 90.0 &amp;&amp; abs(canonicalDestination) &lt;= 180.0 &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">      ((canonicalSource &lt; 0.0) != (canonicalDestination &lt; 0.0))) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">    let sourceUnits = i32(canonicalSource * 131072.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">    let destinationUnits = i32(canonicalDestination * 131072.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">    let turnUnits = select(-47185920, 47185920, canonicalSource &gt; 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">    return f32(destinationUnits - sourceUnits + turnUnits) * 0.00000762939453125;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">  // Canonicalize before subtraction: (tiny + 180) - 180 loses a sub-ulp target from a\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">  // 360-degree origin. Only exact half-turn ties depend on the removed whole-turn parity.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">  let difference = canonicalDestination - canonicalSource;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">  if (abs(difference) == 180.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">    let oddTurns = ((destinationTurns - sourceTurns) % 2) != 0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"140\">    return select(difference, -difference, oddTurns);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"141\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"142\">  return geodesicWrapLongitudeDelta(difference);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"143\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"144\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"145\">// cos(latitude) as sin(colatitude): 90 - |lat| is exact in f32, so the cosine keeps its relative\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"146\">// precision near the poles where cos(lat * pi / 180) would not.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"147\">fn geodesicCosLatitude(latitudeDegrees: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"148\">  return sin((90.0 - abs(latitudeDegrees)) * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"149\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"150\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"151\">fn geodesicUnitVector(lngLat: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; vec3&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"152\">  let lambda = geodesicCanonicalLongitude(geodesicReduceLongitude(lngLat.x)) * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"153\">  let phi = lngLat.y * GEODESIC_DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"154\">  let cosPhi = geodesicCosLatitude(lngLat.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"155\">  return vec3&lt;f32&gt;(cosPhi * cos(lambda), cosPhi * sin(lambda), sin(phi));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"156\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"157\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"158\">fn geodesicFromUnitVector(vector: vec3&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"159\">  let horizontal = sqrt(vector.x * vector.x + vector.y * vector.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"160\">  return vec2&lt;f32&gt;(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"161\">    geodesicAtan2(vector.y,